---
import Network from "../../layouts/Network.astro";
---

<Network
  title="ABF Network — The network"
  description="ABF Network is an independent media structure that develops, coordinates and supports its various media, projects and infrastructure."
>
  <section class="network-hero">
    <div class="network-container">
      <p class="network-eyebrow">ABOUT ABF NETWORK</p>

      <h1>A network designed<br /><span>to create.</span></h1>

      <p class="network-intro">
        ABF Network is an independent media structure bringing together
        several complementary universes around a shared infrastructure,
        a shared vision and a commitment to independence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="network-section" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
    <div class="network-container network-two-column">
      <div>
        <p class="network-eyebrow">OUR MISSION</p>
        <h2 id="mission-title">Build, develop and evolve.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="network-copy">
        <p>
          ABF Network drives the development of its media and digital projects
          digital projects. The network ensures overall consistency while
          allowing each medium to retain its own identity.
        </p>

        <p>
          This organization makes it possible to develop new services,
          new experiences and new formats without changing
          the specific identity of each medium.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="network-section network-section-dark" aria-labelledby="structure-title">
    <div class="network-container">
      <div class="network-section-heading">
        <p class="network-eyebrow">THE NETWORK</p>
        <h2 id="structure-title">One structure. Multiple identities.</h2>
        <p>
          ABF media share a common infrastructure while
          retaining their own editorial identities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="network-identity-grid">
        <article class="network-identity-card radio">
          <span class="network-card-index">01 / RADIO</span>
          <h3>Radio ABF</h3>
          <strong>The DJs' Frequency</strong>
          <p>
            Electronic music, DJ culture, sets and programming
            dedicated to the world of clubs and artists.
          </p>
          <a href="/">Discover Radio ABF <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="network-identity-card abf2">
          <span class="network-card-index">02 / RADIO</span>
          <h3>ABF 2</h3>
          <strong>The Hits Frequency</strong>
          <p>
            An Adult Contemporary station combining pop, rock, alternative,
            standards and current releases.
          </p>
          <a href="/abf2">Discover ABF 2 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>

        <article class="network-identity-card tv">
          <span class="network-card-index">03 / TV</span>
          <h3>ABF TV</h3>
          <strong>The Visual Frequency</strong>
          <p>
            An audiovisual project dedicated to visual culture, cinema,
            animation, documentaries and digital creation.
          </p>
          <a href="/abftv">Discover ABF TV <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="network-section" aria-labelledby="role-title">
    <div class="network-container network-role-grid">
      <div class="network-feature-card">
        <p class="network-eyebrow">NETWORK ROLE</p>
        <h2 id="role-title">The network connects what brings the media together.</h2>
        <p>
          ABF Network handles the shared foundations needed
          to develop the ecosystem: infrastructure, technology,
          digital projects, coordination and service evolution.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="network-list-card">
        <div class="network-list-item">
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Technology</strong>
            <p>Web development, broadcasting, infrastructure and tools.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="network-list-item">
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Projects</strong>
            <p>Design and development of new initiatives.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="network-list-item">
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Partnerships</strong>
            <p>Professional relations et collaborations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="network-list-item">
          <span>04</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Evolution</strong>
            <p>Continuous development of the ABF ecosystem.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="network-section network-section-dark" aria-labelledby="independence-title">
    <div class="network-container network-two-column">
      <div>
        <p class="network-eyebrow">INDEPENDENCE</p>
        <h2 id="independence-title">Independence at the heart of the project.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="network-copy">
        <p>
          ABF Network develops its infrastructure and projects with
          a focus on independence. Technical, editorial and organizational
          choices are designed to allow the network to evolve
          according to its own needs.
        </p>

        <p>
          This independence does not prevent collaboration. On the contrary,
          it provides a clear framework for welcoming partners and projects.
          
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="network-section" aria-labelledby="next-title">
    <div class="network-container">
      <div class="network-feature-card network-next">
        <p class="network-eyebrow">EXPLORE ABF NETWORK</p>
        <h2 id="next-title">Explore the ecosystem.</h2>
        <p>
          Explore our technological approach, press information
          or partnership opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="network-next-links">
          <a href="/network/technology">Technology <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/network/press">Press <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/network/partnerships">Partnerships <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Network>

<style>
  .network-hero {
    padding: 112px 0 120px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 82% 18%, rgba(148,163,184,.13), transparent 48%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, #17191e, #090a0c 72%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  }

  .network-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #aeb4c0;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
  }

  .network-hero h1 {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7.5vw, 104px);
    font-weight: 850;
    line-height: 1.03;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
  }

  .network-hero h1 span {
    color: #aeb4c0;
  }

  .network-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 34px 0 0;
    color: #b8bdc7;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .network-section {
    padding: 96px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  }

  .network-section-dark {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #111318, #08090b);
  }

  .network-two-column {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .network-section h2 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 62px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -.045em;
  }

  .network-copy {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: #b8bdc7;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .network-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .network-section-heading {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .network-section-heading > p:last-child {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: #8f96a3;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .network-identity-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .network-identity-card,
  .network-feature-card,
  .network-list-card {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }

  .network-identity-card {
    min-height: 320px;
    padding: 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .network-identity-card.radio {
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(47,194,255,.65);
  }

  .network-identity-card.abf2 {
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(239,68,68,.65);
  }

  .network-identity-card.tv {
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(168,85,247,.65);
  }

  .network-card-index {
    color: #8f96a3;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
  }

  .network-identity-card h3 {
    margin: 42px 0 6px;
    color: #f3f4f6;
    font-size: 27px;
  }

  .network-identity-card strong {
    color: #aeb4c0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .network-identity-card p {
    margin: 20px 0;
    color: #9da4b0;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .network-identity-card a,
  .network-next-links a {
    margin-top: auto;
    color: #d8dce3;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .network-identity-card a:hover,
  .network-next-links a:hover {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .network-role-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .network-feature-card {
    padding: 38px;
  }

  .network-feature-card h2 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 52px);
  }

  .network-feature-card > p:not(.network-eyebrow) {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    color: #aeb4c0;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .network-list-card {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .network-list-item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  }

  .network-list-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .network-list-item > span {
    color: #737b88;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding-top: 3px;
  }

  .network-list-item strong {
    color: #e5e7eb;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .network-list-item p {
    margin: 7px 0 0;
    color: #8f96a3;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .network-next {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .network-next-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .network-next-links a {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .network-two-column,
    .network-role-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 38px;
    }

    .network-identity-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .network-section {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .network-hero {
      padding: 76px 0 84px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .network-identity-card,
    .network-feature-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .network-hero h1 {
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }

    .network-next-links {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>